- Secure authn/authz; dummy data in `data/`; assets in categorized `public/`
- Universal Axios client in `src/lib/apiClient.ts`; base URL in env; domain APIs in `src/services/api/`
- Jest + React Testing Library; minimum 90% test coverage; zero lint errors

For feature-specific structure and commands, read the current plan at
`specs/001-saas-starter-template/plan.md`.
